    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/kee> ;
    skos:scopeNote "AI-Grounded Retrieval Profile (Draft / Non-Normative); core is owner of record (§6.4). Draft-profile surface; no normative effect from existence or structural validation (§0, §15.6)"@en ;
    skos:note "External relationship: Composes prov:wasGeneratedBy/prov:generatedAtTime for decision provenance; categories are open IRI slots."@en ;
    skos:historyNote "Migration: Retained; no migration."@en .

